app "Zakat Sadqa" coin mint
table given amount money, recipient text, purpose text?
table ramadan starts date
remind "Ramadan is here: calculate zakat" at ramadan.starts
"Given this year" sum(given.amount year) big
"This month" sum(given.amount month) faint
form given, "Add giving"
form ramadan, "Set Ramadan start date"
list given by day
